The vertex group name is in edit mode (text field highlighted). Clicking on the text itself (first point, on the text "sprinkle_density") would place the cursor within the name for editing. The second point is on empty space to the right of the text, within the field, which might also be in the text field... In edit mode, the text field spans the whole row width, but the highlighted selection shows only the text.

The first point is directly on the text, which is the more precise choice for editing the name.

