The status bar shows "模式: 编辑" (Mode: Edit). The instruction "enable editing mode" likely refers to clicking the mode indicator "编辑". The first point is at the "编辑" text (partially obscured by the circle), while the second is at the "模式:" label, closer to the colon.

The first circle sits around x=333, on the "编辑" text; the second sits at x=308, on the label "模式". The editing mode text is "编辑", so the first is better.

