The line tool in the SolidWorks sketch toolbar is the diagonal-line icon at the start of the sketch tools. In the second image, the red circle is on that icon (at the top of the toolbar, with a line-and-square icon). The third image's marker is on the "线条属性" panel title icon, which is a property panel header, not the tool itself.

The first marked point is the toolbar button.

