The instruction is "Line tool". The second image shows the red circle on the 线条属性 panel icon (the Line properties icon), which is a property panel icon rather than the toolbar button. The third image shows the red circle on a toolbar icon in the sketch ribbon, which looks like the line tool (a line with a highlighted corner symbol, next to the smart dimension button).

In SolidWorks, the Line tool in the Sketch toolbar sits next to 智能尺寸 (Smart Dimension), and the marked icon at that position looks like a line/centerline icon. That makes the third image the correct choice.

